#: code:addons/sale_rental/models/sale_order.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"On the sale order line with product %(name)s you are trying to sell a rented"
" product with a quantity (%(uom_qty)s) that is different from the rented "
"quantity (%(rental_qty)s). This is not supported."
