"On the sale order line with rental service %(name)s, you are trying to "
"extend a rental with a rental quantity %(qty)s that is different from the "
"quantity of the original rental %(rental_qty)s. This is not supported."
msgstr ""
"En la línea de pedido de venta con servicio de alquiler %(name)s, está "
"intentando extender un alquiler con una cantidad de alquiler %(qty)s "
"diferente de la cantidad del alquiler original %(rental_qty)s. Esto no es "
"compatible."

